WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.125
Sine and cosine put circles on a ring, and a loop makes twelve.

2
00:00:04.878 --> 00:00:08.878
Cosine gives how far across, and sine how far up or down.

3
00:00:10.403 --> 00:00:14.378
A loop places 12 circles, each a little further round the ring.

4
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:25.600
Change point five and the ring opens or closes. Add frame count to turn it.
